    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the quiet is the worst part tbh. it feels less like \"space\" and more like a void. like i'm just staring into nothing. i look in the mirror and it’s like i'm looking at a stranger. what's the point of even trying to fill it up when the person who was supposed to be there is just... gone? it feels like the version of me that actually mattered died with the relationship.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
